    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h1 id="我的第一篇Blog"><a href="#我的第一篇Blog" class="headerlink" title="我的第一篇Blog"></a>我的第一篇Blog</h1><blockquote><p>本文展示了 <strong>Markdown 的全部常用语法</strong>，可作为速查笔记使用</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="1️⃣-标题（Headings）"><a href="#1️⃣-标题（Headings）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣ 标题（Headings）"></a>1️⃣ 标题（Headings）</h2><p>使用 <code>#</code> 表示标题，数量代表层级。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section"># 一级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">### 三级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">#### 四级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">##### 五级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">###### 六级标题</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="一级标题"><a href="#一级标题" class="headerlink" title="一级标题"></a>一级标题</h1><h2 id="二级标题"><a href="#二级标题" class="headerlink" title="二级标题"></a>二级标题</h2><h3 id="三级标题"><a href="#三级标题" class="headerlink" title="三级标题"></a>三级标题</h3><h4 id="四级标题"><a href="#四级标题" class="headerlink" title="四级标题"></a>四级标题</h4><h5 id="五级标题"><a href="#五级标题" class="headerlink" title="五级标题"></a>五级标题</h5><h6 id="六级标题"><a href="#六级标题" class="headerlink" title="六级标题"></a>六级标题</h6><hr><h2 id="2️⃣-文本格式（Text-Formatting）"><a href="#2️⃣-文本格式（Text-Formatting）" class="headerlink" title="2️⃣ 文本格式（Text Formatting）"></a>2️⃣ 文本格式（Text Formatting）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="strong">**加粗文本**</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="emphasis">*斜体文本*</span></span><br><span class="line">~~删除线文本~~</span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">**<span class="emphasis">*粗斜体文本*</span>**</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">ins</span>&gt;</span></span>下划线文本<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">ins</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">sub</span>&gt;</span></span>下标文本<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">sub</span>&gt;</span></span> 与 <span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">sup</span>&gt;</span></span>上标文本<span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">sup</span>&gt;</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>加粗文本</strong><br><em>斜体文本</em><br><del>删除线文本</del><br><em><strong>粗斜体文本</strong></em><br><ins>下划线文本</ins><br>H<sub>2</sub>O 与 E &#x3D; mc<sup>2</sup></p><hr><h2 id="3️⃣-段落与换行（Paragraph-Line-Break）"><a href="#3️⃣-段落与换行（Paragraph-Line-Break）" class="headerlink" title="3️⃣ 段落与换行（Paragraph &amp; Line Break）"></a>3️⃣ 段落与换行（Paragraph &amp; Line Break）</h2><p>段落之间用空行分隔。<br>换行可在行尾加两个空格或使用 <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">第一行内容  </span><br><span class="line">第二行内容</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这是新段落。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第一行内容<br>第二行内容</p><p>这是新段落。</p><hr><h2 id="4️⃣-引用（Blockquotes）"><a href="#4️⃣-引用（Blockquotes）" class="headerlink" title="4️⃣ 引用（Blockquotes）"></a>4️⃣ 引用（Blockquotes）</h2><p>使用 <code>&gt;</code> 表示引用。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 这是一段引用。</span></span><br><span class="line">&gt;&gt; 可以嵌套引用。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>这是一段引用。</p><blockquote><p>可以嵌套引用。</p></blockquote></blockquote><hr><h2 id="5️⃣-列表（Lists）"><a href="#5️⃣-列表（Lists）" class="headerlink" title="5️⃣ 列表（Lists）"></a>5️⃣ 列表（Lists）</h2><h3 id="🔹-无序列表"><a href="#🔹-无序列表" class="headerlink" title="🔹 无序列表"></a>🔹 无序列表</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 项目一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 项目二</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 子项目</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">    -</span> 子子项目</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>项目一</li><li>项目二<ul><li>子项目<ul><li>子子项目</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h3 id="🔸-有序列表"><a href="#🔸-有序列表" class="headerlink" title="🔸 有序列表"></a>🔸 有序列表</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 第一项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">2.</span> 第二项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">   3.</span> 子项一</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">   4.</span> 子项二</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol><li>第一项  </li><li>第二项  <ol start="3"><li>子项一  </li><li>子项二</li></ol></li></ol><hr><h2 id="6️⃣-任务列表（Task-Lists）"><a href="#6️⃣-任务列表（Task-Lists）" class="headerlink" title="6️⃣ 任务列表（Task Lists）"></a>6️⃣ 任务列表（Task Lists）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> [x] 已完成事项</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> [ ] 未完成事项</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 已完成事项  </li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 未完成事项</li></ul><hr><h2 id="7️⃣-代码（Code）"><a href="#7️⃣-代码（Code）" class="headerlink" title="7️⃣ 代码（Code）"></a>7️⃣ 代码（Code）</h2><h3 id="行内代码"><a href="#行内代码" class="headerlink" title="行内代码"></a>行内代码</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">使用 <span class="code">`print(&quot;Hello&quot;)`</span> 输出。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>使用 <code>print(&quot;Hello&quot;)</code> 输出。</p><h3 id="代码块"><a href="#代码块" class="headerlink" title="代码块"></a>代码块</h3><p>`&#96;&#96;python<br>print(“Hello, world!”)<br>`&#96;&#96;</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Hello, world!&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="8️⃣-链接（Links）"><a href="#8️⃣-链接（Links）" class="headerlink" title="8️⃣ 链接（Links）"></a>8️⃣ 链接（Links）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">百度</span>](<span class="link">https://www.baidu.com</span>)</span><br><span class="line">[<span class="string">带标题的链接</span>](<span class="link">https://www.baidu.com &quot;点击前往百度&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><a href="https://www.baidu.com/">百度</a><br><a href="https://www.baidu.com/" title="点击前往百度">带标题的链接</a></p><hr><h2 id="9️⃣-图片（Images）"><a href="#9️⃣-图片（Images）" class="headerlink" title="9️⃣ 图片（Images）"></a>9️⃣ 图片（Images）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">描述文字</span>](<span class="link">https://via.placeholder.com/150</span>)</span><br><span class="line">![<span class="string">带标题的图片</span>](<span class="link">https://via.placeholder.com/150 &quot;图片标题&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="描述文字"><br><img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="带标题的图片" title="图片标题"></p><hr><h2 id="🔟-表格（Tables）"><a href="#🔟-表格（Tables）" class="headerlink" title="🔟 表格（Tables）"></a>🔟 表格（Tables）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 姓名 | 年龄 | 职业 |</span><br><span class="line">| :-- | --: | :--: |</span><br><span class="line">| 张三 | 25 | 工程师 |</span><br><span class="line">| 李四 | 30 | 设计师 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th align="left">姓名</th><th align="right">年龄</th><th align="center">职业</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">张三</td><td align="right">25</td><td align="center">工程师</td></tr><tr><td align="left">李四</td><td align="right">30</td><td align="center">设计师</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote><p>对齐方式说明：</p><ul><li><code>:--</code> 左对齐  </li><li><code>--:</code> 右对齐  </li><li><code>:--:</code> 居中对齐</li></ul></blockquote><hr><h2 id="1️⃣1️⃣-分隔线（Horizontal-Rule）"><a href="#1️⃣1️⃣-分隔线（Horizontal-Rule）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣1️⃣ 分隔线（Horizontal Rule）"></a>1️⃣1️⃣ 分隔线（Horizontal Rule）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">***</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="strong">__<span class="emphasis">_</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><hr><hr><hr><h2 id="1️⃣2️⃣-转义字符（Escapes）"><a href="#1️⃣2️⃣-转义字符（Escapes）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣2️⃣ 转义字符（Escapes）"></a>1️⃣2️⃣ 转义字符（Escapes）</h2><p>当你想输入 Markdown 保留符号时，在前面加反斜杠 <code>\</code>。</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">\<span class="emphasis">*不会斜体\*</span></span><br><span class="line">\# 不是标题</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>*不会斜体*<br># 不是标题</p><hr><h2 id="1️⃣3️⃣-脚注（Footnotes）"><a href="#1️⃣3️⃣-脚注（Footnotes）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣3️⃣ 脚注（Footnotes）"></a>1️⃣3️⃣ 脚注（Footnotes）</h2><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言[^1]。</span><br><span class="line">[<span class="symbol">^1</span>]: <span class="link">由 John Gruber 创建。</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言[^1]。<br>[^1]: 由 John Gruber 创建。</p><hr><h2 id="1️⃣4️⃣-数学公式（LaTeX-支持）"><a href="#1️⃣4️⃣-数学公式（LaTeX-支持）" class="headerlink" title="1️⃣4️⃣ 数学公式（LaTeX 支持）"></a>1️⃣4️⃣ 数学公式（LaTeX 支持）</h2><p>行内公式：<code>$E = mc^2$</code><br>块级公式：</p><p>```<br>$$<br>\int_0^\infty e^{-x^2} dx &#x3D; rac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}<br>$$<br>```</p><p>显示效果：</p><p>$E &#x3D; mc^2$</p><p>$$<br>\int_0^\infty e^{-x^2} dx &#x3D; rac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}<br>$$</p><p>在 Obsidian 中写数学公式非常简单！Obsidian 支持 LaTeX 语法来渲染数学公式。以下是详细的使用方法：</p><h2 id="1-基本语法"><a href="#1-基本语法" class="headerlink" title="1. 基本语法"></a><strong>1. 基本语法</strong></h2><h3 id="行内公式"><a href="#行内公式" class="headerlink" title="行内公式"></a><strong>行内公式</strong></h3><p>使用单个美元符号 <code>$...$</code>：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">这是一个行内公式：<span class="built_in">$</span>E = mc<span class="built_in">^</span>2<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>显示效果：这是一个行内公式：$E &#x3D; mc^2$</p><h3 id="块级公式"><a href="#块级公式" class="headerlink" title="块级公式"></a><strong>块级公式</strong></h3><p>使用双美元符号 <code>$$...$$</code>：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\int</span><span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;-<span class="keyword">\infty</span>&#125;<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;<span class="keyword">\infty</span>&#125; e<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;-x<span class="built_in">^</span>2&#125; dx = <span class="keyword">\sqrt</span>&#123;<span class="keyword">\pi</span>&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>显示效果：<br>$$<br>\int_{-\infty}^{\infty} e^{-x^2} dx &#x3D; \sqrt{\pi}<br>$$</p><h2 id="2-常用数学符号"><a href="#2-常用数学符号" class="headerlink" title="2. 常用数学符号"></a><strong>2. 常用数学符号</strong></h2><h3 id="上下标"><a href="#上下标" class="headerlink" title="上下标"></a><strong>上下标</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span>x<span class="built_in">^</span>2<span class="built_in">$</span>  <span class="built_in">$</span>x<span class="built_in">_</span>1<span class="built_in">$</span>  <span class="built_in">$</span>x<span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;n+1&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span>  <span class="built_in">$</span>A<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;i&#125;<span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;j&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分数"><a href="#分数" class="headerlink" title="分数"></a><strong>分数</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;a&#125;&#123;b&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span>  <span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\dfrac</span>&#123;a&#125;&#123;b&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="根号"><a href="#根号" class="headerlink" title="根号"></a><strong>根号</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\sqrt</span>&#123;x&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span>  <span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\sqrt</span>[n]&#123;x&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="希腊字母"><a href="#希腊字母" class="headerlink" title="希腊字母"></a><strong>希腊字母</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\alpha</span> <span class="keyword">\beta</span> <span class="keyword">\gamma</span> <span class="keyword">\Gamma</span> <span class="keyword">\Delta</span> <span class="keyword">\Omega</span> <span class="keyword">\omega</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="运算符"><a href="#运算符" class="headerlink" title="运算符"></a><strong>运算符</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\sum</span> <span class="keyword">\prod</span> <span class="keyword">\int</span> <span class="keyword">\oint</span> <span class="keyword">\lim</span> <span class="keyword">\pm</span> <span class="keyword">\times</span> <span class="keyword">\div</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="关系符号"><a href="#关系符号" class="headerlink" title="关系符号"></a><strong>关系符号</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\leq</span> <span class="keyword">\geq</span> <span class="keyword">\neq</span> <span class="keyword">\approx</span> <span class="keyword">\equiv</span> <span class="keyword">\in</span> <span class="keyword">\subset</span> <span class="keyword">\subseteq</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-实用示例"><a href="#3-实用示例" class="headerlink" title="3. 实用示例"></a><strong>3. 实用示例</strong></h2><h3 id="二次方程求根公式"><a href="#二次方程求根公式" class="headerlink" title="二次方程求根公式"></a><strong>二次方程求根公式</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line">x = <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;-b <span class="keyword">\pm</span> <span class="keyword">\sqrt</span>&#123;b<span class="built_in">^</span>2 - 4ac&#125;&#125;&#123;2a&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>显示：<br>$$<br>x &#x3D; \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}<br>$$</p><h3 id="矩阵"><a href="#矩阵" class="headerlink" title="矩阵"></a><strong>矩阵</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line">1 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 2 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 3 <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">4 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 5 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 6 <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">7 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 8 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> 9</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="方程组"><a href="#方程组" class="headerlink" title="方程组"></a><strong>方程组</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;cases&#125;</span><br><span class="line">x + 2y = 7 <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">3x - y = 1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;cases&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="极限"><a href="#极限" class="headerlink" title="极限"></a><strong>极限</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\lim</span><span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;x <span class="keyword">\to</span> <span class="keyword">\infty</span>&#125; <span class="keyword">\left</span>(1 + <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;1&#125;&#123;x&#125;<span class="keyword">\right</span>)<span class="built_in">^</span>x = e</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-高级功能"><a href="#4-高级功能" class="headerlink" title="4. 高级功能"></a><strong>4. 高级功能</strong></h2><h3 id="多行公式对齐"><a href="#多行公式对齐" class="headerlink" title="多行公式对齐"></a><strong>多行公式对齐</strong></h3><p>使用 <code>aligned</code> 环境：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;aligned&#125;</span><br><span class="line">f(x) <span class="built_in">&amp;</span>= (x+1)<span class="built_in">^</span>2 <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">     <span class="built_in">&amp;</span>= x<span class="built_in">^</span>2 + 2x + 1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;aligned&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分段函数"><a href="#分段函数" class="headerlink" title="分段函数"></a><strong>分段函数</strong></h3><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line">f(x) = </span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;cases&#125;</span><br><span class="line">x<span class="built_in">^</span>2 <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> <span class="keyword">\text</span>&#123;if &#125; x <span class="keyword">\geq</span> 0 <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">-x <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> <span class="keyword">\text</span>&#123;if &#125; x &lt; 0</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;cases&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-Obsidian-中的实用技巧"><a href="#5-Obsidian-中的实用技巧" class="headerlink" title="5. Obsidian 中的实用技巧"></a><strong>5. Obsidian 中的实用技巧</strong></h2><h3 id="实时预览"><a href="#实时预览" class="headerlink" title="实时预览"></a><strong>实时预览</strong></h3><ul><li>在编辑模式下，公式会实时渲染</li><li>使用 <code>Ctrl/Cmd + Shift + E</code> 切换源码和预览</li></ul><h3 id="代码块方式"><a href="#代码块方式" class="headerlink" title="代码块方式"></a><strong>代码块方式</strong></h3><p>也可以使用代码块语法：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">```math</span><br><span class="line">f(x) = <span class="keyword">\sum</span><span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;n=0&#125;<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;<span class="keyword">\infty</span>&#125; <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;f<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;(n)&#125;(a)&#125;&#123;n!&#125;(x-a)<span class="built_in">^</span>n</span><br><span class="line">```</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="常用符号快捷键记忆"><a href="#常用符号快捷键记忆" class="headerlink" title="常用符号快捷键记忆"></a><strong>常用符号快捷键记忆</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>分数</strong>: <code>\frac&#123;&#125;&#123;&#125;</code></li><li><strong>上下标</strong>: <code>^</code> 和 <code>_</code></li><li><strong>希腊字母</strong>: <code>\</code> + 字母名（如 <code>\alpha</code>）</li><li><strong>积分</strong>: <code>\int</code></li><li><strong>求和</strong>: <code>\sum</code></li></ul><h2 id="6-完整示例"><a href="#6-完整示例" class="headerlink" title="6. 完整示例"></a><strong>6. 完整示例</strong></h2><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="params">#</span> 数学笔记示例</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">##</span> 微积分基础</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">###</span> 导数定义</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line">f&#x27;(x) = <span class="keyword">\lim</span><span class="built_in">_</span>&#123;h <span class="keyword">\to</span> 0&#125; <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;f(x+h) - f(x)&#125;&#123;h&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">###</span> 常见导数</span><br><span class="line">- <span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;d&#125;&#123;dx&#125; x<span class="built_in">^</span>n = nx<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;n-1&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line">- <span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;d&#125;&#123;dx&#125; e<span class="built_in">^</span>x = e<span class="built_in">^</span>x<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line">- <span class="built_in">$</span><span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;d&#125;&#123;dx&#125; <span class="keyword">\ln</span> x = <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;1&#125;&#123;x&#125;<span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">###</span> 积分公式</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\int</span> x<span class="built_in">^</span>n dx = <span class="keyword">\frac</span>&#123;x<span class="built_in">^</span>&#123;n+1&#125;&#125;&#123;n+1&#125; + C <span class="keyword">\quad</span> (n <span class="keyword">\neq</span> -1)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params">##</span> 线性代数</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">矩阵乘法：</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line">a <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> b <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">c <span class="built_in">&amp;</span> d</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line">x <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">y</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line">=</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\begin</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line">ax + by <span class="keyword">\\</span></span><br><span class="line">cx + dy</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\end</span>&#123;bmatrix&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">$</span><span class="built_in">$</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="7-故障排除"><a href="#7-故障排除" class="headerlink" title="7. 故障排除"></a><strong>7. 故障排除</strong></h2><p>如果公式不显示，请检查：</p><ol><li>是否使用了正确的 <code>$</code> 或 <code>$$</code> 符号</li><li>语法是否正确（括号匹配等）</li><li>是否在设置中启用了数学公式渲染</li></ol><h2 id="小贴士：Obsidian-使用-MathJax-渲染公式，支持绝大部分-LaTeX-数学命令。多练习就能熟练掌握！"><a href="#小贴士：Obsidian-使用-MathJax-渲染公式，支持绝大部分-LaTeX-数学命令。多练习就能熟练掌握！" class="headerlink" title="小贴士：Obsidian 使用 MathJax 渲染公式，支持绝大部分 LaTeX 数学命令。多练习就能熟练掌握！"></a><strong>小贴士</strong>：Obsidian 使用 MathJax 渲染公式，支持绝大部分 LaTeX 数学命令。多练习就能熟练掌握